Changes
=======

v4.0.1 28 Apr 2026
  * CI maintenance: bump actions/cache to 5.0.5.

v4.0.0 19 Apr 2026
  * First stable v4 release. Tracks github.com/lestrrat-go/jwx/v4 v4.0.0.
  * [Security] deriveKey now constructs the KDF input X with a 4-byte
    big-endian length prefix on AlgorithmID per RFC 7518 Section 4.6.2:
    X = be32(len(alg)) || alg || be32(ssLen*8). The previous version
    omitted the length prefix, producing locally-consistent but
    spec-incompatible KDF output. Any existing message produced by
    v4.0.0-alpha1 cannot be decrypted by v4.0.0-alpha2 and vice versa.

v4.0.0-alpha1 13 Apr 2026
  * Initial version, ML-KEM (FIPS 203) support for github.com/lestrrat-go/jwx/v4.
    Implements draft-ietf-jose-pqc-kem (ML-KEM-768, ML-KEM-1024,
    ML-KEM-768+A192KW, ML-KEM-1024+A256KW) for JWE key encryption.
